{"success":true,"code":"000","message":null,"data":{"totalAmount":48,"totalPageCount":1,"pageNum":0,"itemCount":48,"content":[{"pageNum":0,"pageSize":0,"id":"6b050546beecf50d38480d3a","chatId":"737c786bda484f5cad6ed26233a1b540","sessionId":null,"userId":130790,"orgId":3721,"botId":1032,"isGreeting":false,"role":"role","content":"That's the move. Beans are perfect — they take all day, which means you're not bailing halfway, you're there for the long haul, just in the kitchen instead of the living room. And nobody looks at the guy tending a pot; they come to him for a taste and a spoon.\n\nSo the text to Beto isn't \"can I come early.\" It's:\n\n\"Hey — I'm bringing a pot of beans Saturday. What time do you want me there to get them going?\"\n\nThat answers him, commits you, and puts you back in a working role instead of a guest seat. Send that one tonight if you want — it's not the album text, there's nothing heavy in it.\n\nOne thing: beans need to start early, so whatever time he says, that's your arrival. No standing around before the pot's on.","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[{"content":"That's the move. Beans are perfect — they take all day, which means you're not bailing halfway, you're there for the long haul, just in the kitchen instead of the living room. And nobody looks at the guy tending a pot; they come to him for a taste and a spoon.\n\nSo the text to Beto isn't \"can I come early.\" It's:\n\n\"Hey — I'm bringing a pot of beans Saturday. What time do you want me there to get them going?\"\n\nThat answers him, commits you, and puts you back in a working role instead of a guest seat. Send that one tonight if you want — it's not the album text, there's nothing heavy in it.\n\nOne thing: beans need to start early, so whatever time he says, that's your arrival. No standing around before the pot's on.","options":null,"isShow":true,"label":"","evaluate":"","takingTime":3993,"promptTokens":1675,"completionTokens":343,"responseSource":"agent:llm","censorData":{"labels":null,"words":null},"createTime":"2026-11-24 11:32:22"}],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":49,"responseSource":"agent:llm","promptTraceId":"47f5d4b0ecd7437491c53a238df5d6c6","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":2.6118756777205107E-4,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6b050546beecf50d38480d39","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1795491142622,"createTime":"2026-11-24 11:32:22","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null},{"pageNum":0,"pageSize":0,"id":"6b050546beecf50d38480d39","chatId":"737c786bda484f5cad6ed26233a1b540","sessionId":null,"userId":130790,"orgId":3721,"botId":1032,"isGreeting":false,"role":"user","content":"a pot of beans. something that takes all day. if im in the kitchen then nobodys standing around looking at me","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":48,"responseSource":"agent:llm","promptTraceId":"47f5d4b0ecd7437491c53a238df5d6c6","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":2.6118756777205107E-4,"emotions":[{"code":"calm","name":"平静","value":6,"sort":4},{"code":"happy","name":"快乐","value":2,"sort":1},{"code":"anger","name":"愤怒","value":2,"sort":7},{"code":"expect","name":"期待","value":1,"sort":2},{"code":"sadness","name":"悲伤","value":1,"sort":8},{"code":"dislike","name":"厌恶","value":1,"sort":9},{"code":"trust","name":"信任","value":0,"sort":3},{"code":"surprised","name":"惊讶","value":0,"sort":5},{"code":"fear","name":"恐惧","value":0,"sort":6}],"relationId":"6b050546beecf50d38480d3a","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1795491142619,"createTime":"2026-11-24 11:32:22","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null},{"pageNum":0,"pageSize":0,"id":"6b05053bbeecf50d38480d36","chatId":"737c786bda484f5cad6ed26233a1b540","sessionId":null,"userId":130790,"orgId":3721,"botId":1032,"isGreeting":false,"role":"role","content":"Right — so it's not really about the look. It's that you used to be the one who cooked the whole thing, and now you'd be the guy who shows up early and slips out. That's a demotion, and you'd rather not be seen taking it.\n\nThat's a different thing to lose than a marriage. Being the one who cooks for everyone is a place in that room, and it doesn't come back just because you show up.\n\nIs there a version of Saturday where you're not a guest? Bring something — a pot of something, help Beto set up before anyone's there. Not the whole spread like before, but enough that you're working, not standing around being looked at.","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[{"content":"Right — so it's not really about the look. It's that you used to be the one who cooked the whole thing, and now you'd be the guy who shows up early and slips out. That's a demotion, and you'd rather not be seen taking it.\n\nThat's a different thing to lose than a marriage. Being the one who cooks for everyone is a place in that room, and it doesn't come back just because you show up.\n\nIs there a version of Saturday where you're not a guest? Bring something — a pot of something, help Beto set up before anyone's there. Not the whole spread like before, but enough that you're working, not standing around being looked at.","options":null,"isShow":true,"label":"","evaluate":"","takingTime":14040,"promptTokens":1689,"completionTokens":236,"responseSource":"agent:llm","censorData":{"labels":null,"words":null},"createTime":"2026-11-24 11:32:11"}],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":47,"responseSource":"agent:llm","promptTraceId":"c9f25418f3734142a8f643b91b0c5f58","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.0017006835357228404,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6b05053bbeecf50d38480d35","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1795491131921,"createTime":"2026-11-24 11:32:11","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null},{"pageNum":0,"pageSize":0,"id":"6b05053bbeecf50d38480d35","chatId":"737c786bda484f5cad6ed26233a1b540","sessionId":null,"userId":130790,"orgId":3721,"botId":1032,"isGreeting":false,"role":"user","content":"i dont want to be the guy who bails halfway. i used to be the one who cooked for the whole thing","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":46,"responseSource":"agent:llm","promptTraceId":"c9f25418f3734142a8f643b91b0c5f58","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.0017006835357228404,"emotions":[{"code":"trust","name":"信任","value":3,"sort":3},{"code":"calm","name":"平静","value":3,"sort":4},{"code":"sadness","name":"悲伤","value":3,"sort":8},{"code":"dislike","name":"厌恶","value":3,"sort":9},{"code":"fear","name":"恐惧","value":2,"sort":6},{"code":"happy","name":"快乐","value":1,"sort":1},{"code":"expect","name":"期待","value":1,"sort":2},{"code":"anger","name":"愤怒","value":1,"sort":7},{"code":"surprised","name":"惊讶","value":0,"sort":5}],"relationId":"6b05053bbeecf50d38480d36","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1795491131918,"createTime":"2026-11-24 11:32:11","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null},{"pageNum":0,"pageSize":0,"id":"6b05052abeecf50d38480d31","chatId":"737c786bda484f5cad6ed26233a1b540","sessionId":null,"userId":130790,"orgId":3721,"botId":1032,"isGreeting":false,"role":"role","content":"Yeah. That's the whole plan, and it's small on purpose.\n\nIt's not a great plan — it's a plan that gets you in the room without signing you up for the whole afternoon of faces. Coming early and leaving when it gets heavy is still showing up. It's not the same as sitting through all of it, and it's not the same as not going.\n\nBut you're asking like you already know it's not enough. So what would actually be enough — staying the whole time, or is it that you don't want to be the guy who leaves early either?","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[{"content":"Yeah. That's the whole plan, and it's small on purpose.\n\nIt's not a great plan — it's a plan that gets you in the room without signing you up for the whole afternoon of faces. Coming early and leaving when it gets heavy is still showing up. It's not the same as sitting through all of it, and it's not the same as not going.\n\nBut you're asking like you already know it's not enough. So what would actually be enough — staying the whole time, or is it that you don't want to be the guy who leaves early either?","options":null,"isShow":true,"label":"","evaluate":"","takingTime":3433,"promptTokens":1703,"completionTokens":246,"responseSource":"agent:llm","censorData":{"labels":null,"words":null},"createTime":"2026-11-24 11:31:54"}],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":45,"responseSource":"agent:llm","promptTraceId":"b98cc01b9e4b4eb58420e3af16f3db8f","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":1.7952642649902864E-4,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6b05052abeecf50d38480d30","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1795491114585,"createTime":"2026-11-24 11:31:54","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null